### Page Container Styles (Vela JS)

Source: https://iot.mi.com/vela/quickapp/zh/guide/start/user-interface

Styles the main page container, setting padding, background color to black, and a circular border radius. It also defines the page width relative to a base design width for screen adaptation.

```CSS
.page {
  padding: 40px;
  background-color: #000000;
  width: 480px;
  border-radius: 240px;
}


```

